{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"personal data personal data","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md","fileName":"Personal Data.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Personal Data","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 22:42\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Big Data Governance and Quality]] · [[Big Data Law and Individual Rights]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Big Data Governance and Quality","Big Data Law and Individual Rights","bigdatamanagementandprocessing.pdf","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"personal data personal data","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md","fileName":"Personal Data.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Personal Data","heading":"Personal Data","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Personal data is any information that relates to an identified or identifiable natural person. The definition reaches beyond names and direct identifiers: a record can become personal when it can be connected to someone through available means or combined with other information.\n\nIn big-data systems, identifiability is contextual. Seemingly anonymous observations may reveal a person through patterns, linkage, or inference, so governance must examine the complete processing environment rather than each field in isolation.\n\nThe legal distinction between personal and anonymous data is therefore better understood as a scale than as a permanent binary. Information can move toward identifiability when it is combined with other records or analyzed with stronger techniques.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Big Data Governance and Quality","Big Data Law and Individual Rights","bigdatamanagementandprocessing.pdf","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"personal data personal data","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Personal Data.md","fileName":"Personal Data.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Personal Data","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[bigdatamanagementandprocessing.pdf]]\n\n[[frontiersofdatascience.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Big Data Governance and Quality","Big Data Law and Individual Rights","bigdatamanagementandprocessing.pdf","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}